  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kube Energy AS feasibility studies solar minigrids Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kube Energy supplies electricity from off-grid energy solutions so communities, government agencies, businesses and organizations can access clean energy, reduce energy costs, streamline operations and lower carbon emissions.

The project consists of feasibility studies around new solar mini-grids at two sites and work with the Somali national and regional governments for an improved regulatory framework.</narrative>
  </description>
